{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_01",
      "hash": "1fbce5f2fab397f0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳果然來了！\\n其實我早有預感！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_06",
      "hash": "1fbcecf2fab3a3d5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "自從我隨手把湯匙一扔\\n就讓它彎曲的那一天起……\\r\\n我就成了一個超能力少女。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_07",
      "hash": "1fbcebf2fab3a222",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然我不喜歡戰鬥，\\n但既然[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這麼希望……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_08",
      "hash": "1fbceef2fab3a73b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我就讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳見識一下\\n我的力量吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_06_02",
      "hash": "76d3c84d70ea30bd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_02",
      "hash": "1fbce8f2fab39d09",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為了證明[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳勝過了我，\\n這個金色徽章就送給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8040_sys_01",
      "hash": "659e0516ed84877e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從娜姿那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]金色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_03",
      "hash": "1fbce7f2fab39b56",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了金色徽章，\\n就算是別人送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢，\\r\\n只要等級在[VAR NUM2(0004)]以內，\\r\\n牠們都會乖乖聽話！\\c\\n還有……！\\n把這個招式學習器帶走吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8040_sys_02",
      "hash": "659e0416ed8485cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從娜姿那裡\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n「[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_04",
      "hash": "1fbceaf2fab3a06f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器33是「冥想」！\\n這是一種透過集中精神\\r\\n來提高特攻和特防的招式喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_05",
      "hash": "1fbce9f2fab39ebc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "超能力並不是\\n只屬於少數人的能力！\\r\\n無論是誰都擁有超能力！\\r\\n只是大家沒有意識到而已。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_06_07",
      "hash": "76d3c34d70ea283e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 11]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8040_max",
